<title>FRANCE: French band out of tune with taxman.</title>
<headline>French band out of tune with taxman.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>French authorities have seized musical instruments from the municipal band in the southern town of Montpellier to ensure it will pay tax arrears, a town hall spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Seized for a debt of 46 million francs ($9 million) were two double basses, several flutes and the band's triangle.</p>
